I'm not sure why `all=TRUE` isn't being passed to merge from do.call.

Another approach, which is maybe related to Duncan's solution, is to skip do.call and use `Reduce`. Replace the final line with

test <- Reduce(function(x, y) merge(x, y, by="food", all=TRUE), dta2)

